        <mxCell id="erd-cataloginventory-note-v29" value="V29 / V30: image_url and description are F09 display metadata (the public card). The Storefront key is store.slug (V27); store_slug and storefront_enabled of the old F09 merge were dropped by V30." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1">
